/// FFI-backed [SqliteEngine] on `package:sqlite3`, for VM/desktop/mobile
/// hosts. Exported only from `lib/io.dart` (the `dart:io` entry point) so
/// the core library stays pure Dart and web-compilable; web hosts construct
